    <div class="highlight-box">
        <p>💡 In short: ClipAlbum is a local-first private album. Your photos, videos, and album data are, by default, stored only on your own device. We operate no servers and do not collect, upload, sell, or share your personal information.</p>
    </div>

    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how the App handles your information. It is intended to comply with the privacy and data-protection laws of jurisdictions including the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, Australia, New Zealand, and other countries where English is an official language. Where the mandatory laws of your country or region grant you greater rights, those laws prevail.</p>

