                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <strong><td>In-App Deletion</td></strong>
                        <td>Controlled by you.</td>
                        <td>You can delete individual files or albums at any time within the App.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <strong><td>iCloud Data</td></strong>
                        <td>Stored in your personal iCloud.</td>
                        <td>Manage or delete the data via your system <strong>iCloud settings</strong>.</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="section-8">
        <h2>8. Security</h2>
        <p>Your files are stored in the App's private directory protected by the operating system. We recommend enabling a device passcode and <strong>Face ID / Touch ID</strong>. <small style="color: #64748b;">(Note: No method of storage is completely secure.)</small></p>
    </section>

    <section id="section-9">
        <h2>9. International Data Transfers</h2>
        <p>We do not transfer your personal information internationally because we do not collect it. Any iCloud data is handled by Apple in accordance with Apple's policies.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="section-10">
        <h2>10. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>The App is not directed to children. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13 (United States, in compliance with COPPA), under 16 (where applicable in the UK/EEA), or under the equivalent minimum age in your jurisdiction.</p>
    </section>

